        "content": [
          "To initiate the process in the Pathology Department, begin with the Gross pathology request that has arrived.",
          "proceed with the Registration gross pathology request.",
          "During the \"Registration gross pathology request\" step, make sure to create a barcode scan at the start.",
          "Once the registration is complete, assign a container to the gross pathology request.",
          "move on to the Specimen description.",
          "pay attention to the scan start.",
          "Then, pay attention to the scan end.",
          "Finally, pay attention to the scan start again for the Registration gross pathology request (cont.) step.",
          "proceed with Macroscopic description writing. Simultaneously, complete the following steps: Tissue processing,",
          "Next, check if \"Digitalization?\" is required again.",
          "assign cases to the pathologist",
          "move on to Microscopic examination and diagnosis.",
          "write the pathology report.",
          "confirm it.",
          "deliver it.",
          "proceed with the post-report processing.",
          "To conclude the pathology procedure, close it.",
          "close it",
          "Finally, deliver the pathology report and complete the post-report processing.",
          "deliver the pathology report"
        ]
      },
